column37:
Interesting. I never knew I was doing CSS Reset all this time. I add this to the top of most of my CSS files:<p><pre><code>    body, html, form {
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
    }
    table {
      border-collapse:collapse;
    }
    a {
      text-decoration:none;
    }
</code></pre>
There are a few more rules I add but they depend on each site of course.
